---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Long Short Market Neutral Funds | The Sovereign Ledger" currentPage="products/funds/long-short-market-neutral">

<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-8 lg:max-w-5xl">

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-secondary mb-8 pt-4">
    <a href="/knowledge/aif" class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label hover:text-primary-container transition-colors">AIF Knowledge</a>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-secondary">Cat III AIF</span>
    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]">chevron_right</span>
    <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] font-label text-on-surface">Long Short Market Neutral</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
      <span class="bg-secondary/10 text-secondary text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1">Category III AIF</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="font-headline text-5xl md:text-6xl font-light leading-tight text-primary-container mb-4">
      Long Short Market <span class="italic">Neutral</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed text-lg max-w-2xl">
      Pure alpha extraction through rigorous stock selection, stripped of all directional market risk—delivering equity-linked returns with near-zero correlation to broader market indices.
    </p>
  </section>

  <!-- Definition & Purpose -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 md:p-10 relative overflow-hidden">
      <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-6 text-primary-container">Definition & Purpose</h2>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Long Short Market Neutral Funds under Category III AIF maintain portfolios with a net market exposure (beta) close to zero, balancing long positions in companies expected to outperform against short positions in companies expected to underperform within the same sector or risk factor group. Return generation is entirely driven by the spread between winning long and winning short positions—pure alpha divorced from market direction. These funds are most valuable in portfolio construction as genuine diversifiers that perform regardless of whether broad equity markets rise or fall.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">balance</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Focus</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Market-Neutral Returns</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">monitoring</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Risk Profile</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Moderate</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">payments</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Min. Investment</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">&#8377;1 Crore</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-4">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary mb-2 block">schedule</span>
          <h4 class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-1">Tenure</h4>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Open-Ended</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Characteristics -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-10 text-primary-container pl-4 border-l-2 border-tertiary-fixed">
      Key <span class="italic">Characteristics</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">commit</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2 text-on-surface">Beta-Hedged Portfolio Construction</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Each long position is paired with a corresponding short position of equal or near-equal beta-adjusted value, ensuring the portfolio's sensitivity to broad market moves is minimized to a target range of -0.2 to +0.2. Factor exposure—size, value, momentum, quality—is also monitored and neutralized to ensure returns reflect only stock-specific alpha and not unintended systematic risk loadings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">compare_arrows</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2 text-on-surface">Pair Trading Architecture</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">The fundamental expression of market neutral investing is the pair trade—a simultaneous long and short in two highly correlated securities where the manager believes relative value will converge or diverge in their favor. Pairs are constructed within sectors or supply chains to minimize exogenous macro risk, with statistical and fundamental validation of the spread relationship before position initiation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-6 items-start">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 flex items-center justify-center bg-primary-container text-tertiary-fixed">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">scatter_plot</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2 text-on-surface">Low Correlation to Other Assets</h3>
          <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Because market neutral returns are driven by stock-specific alpha rather than market beta, realized correlation to equity indices, bond markets, and commodity prices is structurally low. This makes market neutral allocations uniquely effective portfolio diversifiers for institutional investors seeking to reduce overall portfolio volatility without sacrificing return potential through cash or fixed-income ballast.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lifecycle -->
  <section class="mb-16 bg-primary-container p-8 md:p-12 overflow-hidden relative">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-12 text-tertiary-fixed">The Market Neutral Fund <span class="italic">Lifecycle</span></h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div>
        <div class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">Phase 01</div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl text-tertiary-fixed mb-3">Idea Generation & Pair Selection</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">Investment ideas emerge from fundamental research screens identifying relative valuation discrepancies within peer groups, and from statistical analysis of historical price spread behavior. Pairs are validated for economic rationale, minimum historical correlation thresholds, and sufficient liquidity in both legs to enable frictionless position sizing and exit.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">Phase 02</div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl text-tertiary-fixed mb-3">Risk-Controlled Execution</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">Positions are executed to achieve target beta neutrality at the portfolio level, verified through factor model attribution daily. Stop-loss rules are rigorously enforced on spread positions that move adversely, limiting the impact of any single pair thesis failure. Portfolio-level gross exposure is managed within SEBI-mandated AIF leverage limits.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-tertiary-fixed-dim text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-[0.2em] mb-3">Phase 03</div>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl text-tertiary-fixed mb-3">Convergence & Harvest</h3>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">Profits are realized when the fundamental mispricing converges—the long outperforms the short as the market recognizes the relative value gap. Positions are closed when thesis targets are achieved, when holding periods expire, or when catalyst risk makes continuation inadvisable. Continuous reinvestment of harvested alpha into new pairs sustains return generation through the fund's operating life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Notable Benchmarks -->
  <section class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl mb-8 text-primary-container">Institutional <span class="italic">Benchmarks</span></h2>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 border-l-2 border-tertiary-fixed">
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2 text-on-surface">Alchemy Capital Management</h3>
        <p class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">Quantamental Market Neutral</p>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">Alchemy Capital combines quantitative factor screening with fundamental validation to construct market neutral books in Indian equities. Their investment process integrates earnings quality scoring, short-interest analytics, and sector-relative valuation to generate a continuously refreshed pipeline of pair trade candidates with high probability of spread convergence within defined time horizons.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 border-l-2 border-tertiary-fixed">
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl mb-2 text-on-surface">360 ONE Asset Management</h3>
        <p class="text-xs font-label uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">Diversified Alternatives Platform</p>
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm leading-relaxed">360 ONE's alternatives platform manages market neutral strategies alongside its broader AIF lineup. Their market neutral vehicles apply systematic factor neutralization and rigorous risk management to generate equity-linked alpha with significantly lower drawdown characteristics than directional equity strategies. The platform's scale provides access to superior research infrastructure and derivative execution across the NSE and BSE.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="bg-surface-container p-8 text-center border border-outline-variant/10">
    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl mb-4 text-on-surface">Explore This Strategy</h3>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm mb-8">Access detailed regulatory filings and performance metrics through our private concierge.</p>
    <a href="/partner" class="inline-block w-full md:w-auto py-4 px-10 bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors">
      Request Fund Prospectus
    </a>
  </div>

</div>

</BaseLayout>
